rds before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 46.3% year on year (Q2 2026 vs Q2 2025), reaching $393.8m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1793659/000179365926000048/0001793659-26-000048-index.htm","accession":"0001793659-26-000048"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1793659/000179365926000048/0001793659-26-000048-index.htm","accession":"0001793659-26-000048"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $55.5m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1793659/000179365926000023/0001793659-26-000023-index.htm","accession":"0001793659-26-000023"},{"text":"Net cash of $345.4m against total assets of $793.3m - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1793659/000179365926000048/0001793659-26-000048-index.htm","accession":"0001793659-26-000048"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-50.6% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1793659/000179365926000048/0001793659-26-000048-index.htm","accession":"0001793659-26-000048"}],"bear":[{"text":"Insiders disposed of 59.2% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (1,423,518 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1793659/000158889426000016/0001588894-26-000016-index.htm"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.8% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1793659/000158889426000016/0001588894-26-000016-index.htm"},{"text":